HOW TO IMPORT DATA
==================
hi , use the below commands to import data, ty
CLEANED DATA (use this for analysis):

    from cleaned_data import get_mumbai_cleaned, get_delhi_cleaned, get_dehradun_cleaned, get_jodhpur_cleaned

    mumbai   = get_mumbai_cleaned()
    delhi    = get_delhi_cleaned()
    dehradun = get_dehradun_cleaned()
    jodhpur  = get_jodhpur_cleaned()

    # combine all 4
    import pandas as pd
    all_cities = pd.concat([mumbai, delhi, dehradun, jodhpur], ignore_index=True)


RAW DATA (only if you need data before cleaning):

    from raw_data import get_mumbai_raw, get_delhi_raw, get_dehradun_raw, get_jodhpur_raw

    mumbai_raw = get_mumbai_raw()


NOTE: both raw_data/ and cleaned_data/ folders must be in the same directory
